# With Urza's Mine, Urza's Power Plant and Urza's Tower all controlled, each takes its "instead" amount: the Mine and the
# Power Plant add {C}{C} each and the Tower {C}{C}{C}, seven in all; before the Tower arrives the Mine adds only {C}
# (CR 605.1a, 205.3i; rulings 2004-10-04, 2024-06-07).
[Bot1 Deck]
Urza's Mine
Urza's Power Plant
Urza's Tower
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Urza's Mine.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Urza's Power Plant.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Mine.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Urza's Tower.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Mine.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}{C}
Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Power Plant.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}{C}{C}{C}
Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Tower.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}
[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}{C}
